{
  "name": "Screen a new supplier: register status, insolvency and sanctions, alert on fail or review",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Screen a new supplier\n\nRuns one counterparty check on a supplier and builds an alert when a check fails or needs review: register status, insolvency, recent accounts, and sanctions lists (OFAC, UN, UK, EU, US export lists) for the company and, where the register publishes them, its officers.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-boscolabs** (nodes panel, or Settings > Community Nodes).\n2. Get a Bosco Labs API key at [boscolabs.dev/api.html](https://boscolabs.dev/api.html#key) and save it as a **Bosco Labs API** credential.\n3. Pick that credential in each Bosco Labs node.\n4. Replace **New Supplier** with your own trigger (procurement form, ERP, spreadsheet row). A registration number or LEI in `supplier` avoids name mix-ups; `country` is optional.\n5. Connect Slack, e-mail or a ticket after **Build Alert**, and your onboarding step after **Supplier Clear**.\n\n### Cost per supplier\n$0.05 per company checked. A name that fits several companies returns candidates and costs nothing (see **Pick the Right Company**).\n\n### Coverage\nInsolvency sources exist for the UK, Poland, France, Germany, the Netherlands, Norway, Finland, Estonia, Ireland, the Czech Republic and Latvia. For other countries that check is `unverified`, which means not checked, not safe. The alert lists `unverified` checks too. This is a screening aid, not a compliance decision: review every fail and review.",
        "height": 680,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "54dd422b-756f-5600-b81b-46e3065810c7",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -440,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "cdf135ab-a262-58c4-a087-3b7cbd3f7462",
      "name": "When clicking 'Execute workflow'",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "035acd2e-351a-5314-bbda-2966c082e0cc",
              "name": "supplier",
              "value": "Carillion plc",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fb7096be-7198-5863-9a22-a0664a021bf6",
              "name": "country",
              "value": "GB",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "98f9f6e7-2f09-552c-9816-d2278dce4e43",
      "name": "New Supplier",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        260,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "company",
        "operation": "checkCounterparty",
        "query": "={{ $json.supplier }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "country": "={{ $json.country }}"
        },
        "simplify": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c8f59aac-11b0-5dab-befc-6822c0ee53ef",
      "name": "Check Supplier",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-boscolabs.boscoLabs",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cfae5041-b3ef-520d-9adc-910e82a02ede",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "checked",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a5bab573-151d-5843-95a9-cab9589a6fd2",
      "name": "Company Identified?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        700,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "6b202798-8157-5aae-9a22-114acd13fb33",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.summary.fail }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "47f1a149-6c80-522c-96b8-7fc92ef8d91c",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.summary.review }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c7327a24-2d92-5115-a8ba-0d8290065d14",
      "name": "Fail or Review?",
